OL,5,G1400 Jane McDonald in Nashville
OL,6,     FThe singer and presenter takes a
OL,7,     Fdream trip to Nashville, seeking
OL,8,     Finspiration for her country album,
OL,9,     Fand discovering why millions of
OL,10,     Ftourists flock to the Tennessee
OL,11,     Fcapital every year. (Ep1/2)
OL,12,G1500 Jane McDonald in Nashville
OL,13,     FJane visits the Bluebird Cafe for
OL,14,     Fopen mic night, braves Nashville's
OL,15,     Fhot chicken; tours the Grand Ole
OL,16,     FOpry; and ends her trip on
OL,17,     FBroadway with - of course! - a
OL,18,     Fcountry song performance! (Ep2/2)
